1
00:01:37,789 --> 00:01:43,060
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:43,740
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,740 --> 00:01:45,930
[Episode 26]

4
00:01:47,789 --> 00:01:48,590
Look.

5
00:01:48,590 --> 00:01:49,120
This...

6
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,710
The Dragon King has manifested!

7
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:56,509
The Dragon King has manifested!

8
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,789
The Dragon King has manifested!

9
00:01:57,789 --> 00:01:59,590
The Dragon King has manifested!

10
00:01:59,789 --> 00:02:01,590
The Dragon King has manifested!

11
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:04,000
Oh no.

12
00:02:07,950 --> 00:02:08,800
Don't panic, Your Highness.

13
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,600
The Grand Heir Apparent is safe.

14
00:02:11,430 --> 00:02:12,630
Grand Heir Apparent!

15
00:02:12,630 --> 00:02:13,490
Your Highness.

16
00:02:15,430 --> 00:02:16,430
-Your Highness.
-Your Highness.

17
00:02:16,430 --> 00:02:17,240
Ye.

18
00:02:21,870 --> 00:02:22,800
What's going on?

19
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,970
There's no blood.

20
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:27,840
Your Highness...

21
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:30,560
The Grand Heir Apparent...

22
00:02:31,630 --> 00:02:33,520
He has been dead for a long time.

23
00:02:35,910 --> 00:02:36,710
Speak!

24
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,630
Who sent you?

25
00:02:38,630 --> 00:02:40,079
The Crown Prince is incompetent

26
00:02:40,079 --> 00:02:41,710
and wants to succeed to the throne
through his son.

27
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:43,430
Now that the Grand Heir Apparent is dead,

28
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:44,740
the world of Great Shi

29
00:02:44,770 --> 00:02:46,400
will ultimately belong
to His Highness Prince Ding.

30
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,240
Lies.

31
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:48,630
Speak.

32
00:02:49,470 --> 00:02:51,600
What is your relationship with Liluo?

33
00:03:01,430 --> 00:03:03,120
First Prince Zhou Miao

34
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:05,080
ordered assassins

35
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,650
to murder his royal nephew.

36
00:03:07,310 --> 00:03:08,590
His wild ambitions

37
00:03:08,590 --> 00:03:10,000
are glaringly obvious!

38
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,430
It is an unforgivable crime!

39
00:03:11,430 --> 00:03:12,360
Huo Daozhang!

40
00:03:13,590 --> 00:03:16,070
The Crown Prince ordered you
to escort the body here

41
00:03:16,070 --> 00:03:17,520
for this exact moment.

42
00:03:18,310 --> 00:03:20,280
You used Zhou Ye's corpse as bait

43
00:03:20,910 --> 00:03:23,050
to lure the First Prince into a trap

44
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:25,030
before sending assassins here.

45
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:26,630
Once the crime is confirmed,

46
00:03:27,030 --> 00:03:28,430
His Highness Prince Ding

47
00:03:28,630 --> 00:03:30,760
will never have a chance to rise again.

48
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,120
Your Highness!

49
00:03:43,590 --> 00:03:45,450
The great cause is accomplished.

50
00:03:46,030 --> 00:03:48,350
I have done my duty

51
00:03:49,079 --> 00:03:50,010
with no regrets.

52
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:53,470
To think the Crown Prince is so ruthless

53
00:03:54,190 --> 00:03:55,750
to his own flesh and blood.

54
00:03:55,910 --> 00:03:56,710
No.

55
00:03:57,910 --> 00:04:00,590
When we welcomed
the Grand Heir Apparent that day,

56
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:01,910
he was perfectly fine.

57
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,480
You...

58
00:04:39,830 --> 00:04:40,720
Lord Huo.

59
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,530
When you served
as the Vice Minister of Works,

60
00:04:44,390 --> 00:04:45,990
Tang Yiming once personally taught you

61
00:04:45,990 --> 00:04:47,850
the art of intricate mechanisms.

62
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,310
Using mechanical devices

63
00:04:49,310 --> 00:04:50,920
to control a corpse

64
00:04:52,190 --> 00:04:54,390
shouldn't be difficult for you, right?

65
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,070
Huo Daozhang.

66
00:05:14,270 --> 00:05:16,040
How will you explain such dirty deeds

67
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,580
to His Majesty in the future?

68
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:18,930
Prince Ping,

69
00:05:19,270 --> 00:05:21,560
you are too naive.

70
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:24,310
If the Grand Heir Apparent's corpse
is destroyed,

71
00:05:24,310 --> 00:05:25,770
there will be no evidence.

72
00:05:26,270 --> 00:05:27,870
Why would we need to explain?

73
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,360
Master Yun Hai!

74
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,159
Come out.

75
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:42,310
Master, your martial arts skills
are exceptional.

76
00:05:42,310 --> 00:05:44,830
Help me destroy
the Grand Heir Apparent's corpse,

77
00:05:44,830 --> 00:05:45,920
and the Crown Prince

78
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,870
can rest easy with no worries.

79
00:05:48,390 --> 00:05:50,720
All the evil karma created in the past

80
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:54,250
stems from beginningless greed,
anger, and ignorance.

81
00:06:00,510 --> 00:06:01,390
Lord Huo.

82
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,950
When did I ever promise

83
00:06:04,270 --> 00:06:05,800
to help you?

84
00:06:06,070 --> 00:06:06,870
Master,

85
00:06:07,870 --> 00:06:09,120
what do you mean?

86
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:11,630
When you pledged allegiance
to the Crown Prince,

87
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:13,040
you clearly promised

88
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,320
to do your utmost

89
00:06:14,350 --> 00:06:16,350
to help him succeed to the throne!

90
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:17,480
Now,

91
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,680
are you going back on your word?

92
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:21,730
The one who promised you back then

93
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:23,190
was Yun Hai,

94
00:06:23,870 --> 00:06:25,160
not me.

95
00:06:25,190 --> 00:06:26,040
You...

96
00:06:29,190 --> 00:06:30,670
You are not Yun Hai?

97
00:06:30,870 --> 00:06:32,430
Of course he's not Yun Hai.

98
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:39,920
He's the shadow puppeteer
who fell off a cliff 6 years ago

99
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,310
and became a vengeful spirit,

100
00:06:41,310 --> 00:06:44,000
seeking revenge for his wife and child,

101
00:06:44,310 --> 00:06:45,310
Yin Jie.

102
00:07:04,190 --> 00:07:09,600
Flat hands, flat feet,
a body flat as can be.

103
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:14,920
Yet it claims to be human, not a shadow.

104
00:07:16,510 --> 00:07:22,300
Is it a puppet performing shadow play,

105
00:07:22,870 --> 00:07:29,360
or a shadow puppet wearing human skin?

106
00:07:36,430 --> 00:07:38,270
Stop playing tricks here.

107
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:41,040
Turning into a vengeful spirit
for revenge,

108
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,430
cutting out hearts and livers,

109
00:07:42,430 --> 00:07:43,920
and confusing people's minds...

110
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,600
It was you who gave Liluo's Dark Night

111
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:46,750
the idea, right?

112
00:07:47,630 --> 00:07:49,190
On the night of the lunar eclipse,

113
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:51,120
the ones who caused chaos
with shadow puppets,

114
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,630
set up an illusion formation,

115
00:07:52,630 --> 00:07:54,240
and put on a show of false strength

116
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,310
were also you

117
00:07:56,630 --> 00:07:57,960
and Liluo's Dark Night.

118
00:07:58,830 --> 00:08:00,160
He's Yin Jie?

119
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,630
If Yin Jie were still alive,

120
00:08:03,630 --> 00:08:05,480
he wouldn't be an old man.

121
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,630
It's because of the Frost Moth.

122
00:08:07,630 --> 00:08:08,920
If the Frost Moth is in a dead body,

123
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,800
it can preserve it.

124
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,160
But if it's in a living body,

125
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,430
it will suck their essence and blood,

126
00:08:12,430 --> 00:08:14,030
causing them to age rapidly.

127
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,480
For so many years,

128
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:17,020
the Frost Moth must have been

129
00:08:17,020 --> 00:08:18,070
kept in his body.

130
00:08:18,630 --> 00:08:20,390
Yun Hai was in seclusion
for over 20 years.

131
00:08:20,390 --> 00:08:21,830
Even if he took his place,

132
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,720
no one would suspect a thing.

133
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:27,260
Everyone loved my shadow plays,

134
00:08:27,630 --> 00:08:30,410
but when my wife and child suffered,

135
00:08:30,630 --> 00:08:33,030
no one helped!

136
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:35,620
I killed the murderers for revenge,

137
00:08:35,669 --> 00:08:37,750
but they treated me as a sinner

138
00:08:37,789 --> 00:08:39,030
and hunted me down!

139
00:08:39,030 --> 00:08:40,190
But tell me!

140
00:08:49,240 --> 00:08:52,020
What crime did I commit?

141
00:08:52,630 --> 00:08:53,960
In this world,

142
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:57,320
right and wrong have long been confused,

143
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:59,470
and black and white reversed!

144
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,320
Then...

145
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:07,670
Let it all be destroyed...

146
00:09:08,270 --> 00:09:10,180
The divine dragon treads the sea,

147
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,700
turning the earth into the sky!

148
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,930
Changlai Bun Shop.

149
00:09:30,950 --> 00:09:33,240
I assume you have all been there.

150
00:09:33,630 --> 00:09:34,870
Now do you know

151
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:38,440
why those people acted up?

152
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,280
It's the water vapor.

153
00:09:44,150 --> 00:09:45,050
Here they are,

154
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,870
freshly steamed buns.

155
00:09:52,270 --> 00:09:54,630
The steamers in the bun shop
produced the steam.

156
00:09:54,630 --> 00:09:55,830
And the herb gatherer

157
00:09:55,870 --> 00:09:58,200
was affected by the mist in the mountains.

158
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:01,120
It's all because of water vapor.

159
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:03,480
I also need a magical artifact
and incantation

160
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,960
to awaken the Chiying bugs.

161
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:07,090
Those people were just an experiment.

162
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:09,770
I added Chiying bugs into the Dragon Pond.

163
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,910
Once the mist covers the area.

164
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,170
anyone who has drunk the holy water

165
00:10:15,480 --> 00:10:17,870
will act up and die.

166
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,250
By then,

167
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,470
the entire Gutan County

168
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:23,750
will become a living hell.

169
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:24,790
This

170
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:29,030
is the blessing that
His Highness the Grand Heir Apparent

171
00:10:29,030 --> 00:10:32,030
has sought for our Great Shi Dynasty.

172
00:10:34,870 --> 00:10:36,960
You were a citizen of Great Shi,

173
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:39,610
but you colluded with the enemies

174
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:41,870
to destroy the foundation of Great Shi.

175
00:10:42,270 --> 00:10:44,040
I will fight you to the death!

176
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:56,080
I'm sorry, Crown Prince...

177
00:10:57,340 --> 00:11:00,590
I'm sorry, Great Shi...

178
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:01,840
Yin Jie!

179
00:11:10,220 --> 00:11:12,600
[Golden Dragon Hall]

180
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:14,910
Yan, be careful.

181
00:11:15,030 --> 00:11:17,560
This person's martial arts
are very bizarre.

182
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,480
Why is Yin Jie's inner power

183
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:59,120
so similar to

184
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,580
Meng Rui's sword aura?

185
00:12:38,270 --> 00:12:39,440
Yin Jie.

186
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:42,460
You only know how to hate people,

187
00:12:42,670 --> 00:12:43,600
but you yourself

188
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:46,440
are also blinded by hatred.

189
00:12:46,910 --> 00:12:49,390
You keep talking about karma,

190
00:12:50,030 --> 00:12:51,510
but you must not know

191
00:12:51,910 --> 00:12:53,000
that your son

192
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:54,750
is still alive in this world.

193
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:00,630
But he has likely

194
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:02,620
already drunk

195
00:13:02,650 --> 00:13:04,560
the holy water you poisoned.

196
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:06,180
This is the Golden Dragon Pavilion
holy water

197
00:13:06,180 --> 00:13:07,610
that Uncle Huang specially asked someone

198
00:13:07,610 --> 00:13:09,060
to get for you.

199
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:10,730
Hong,

200
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:11,730
drink it all in one gulp.

201
00:13:11,730 --> 00:13:12,900
It will keep you healthy

202
00:13:12,900 --> 00:13:14,240
and help you grow up safely.

203
00:13:14,240 --> 00:13:15,690
Thank you, Uncle Huang.

204
00:13:16,710 --> 00:13:18,410
My son...

205
00:13:23,190 --> 00:13:23,990
No.

206
00:13:25,550 --> 00:13:26,630
Impossible!

207
00:13:27,550 --> 00:13:29,550
My Hong is already dead!

208
00:13:29,670 --> 00:13:30,880
You're lying to me!

209
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:46,080
My Hong...

210
00:13:47,750 --> 00:13:49,650
And my Yu'er...

211
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,510
They

212
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:55,910
are all dead.

213
00:13:58,960 --> 00:14:00,120
All dead.

214
00:14:00,150 --> 00:14:01,080
You fool!

215
00:14:03,030 --> 00:14:04,320
Your son was saved by Boss Huang

216
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,670
of the Xiangrui Shadow Puppet Shop.

217
00:14:05,670 --> 00:14:06,730
But what did you do?

218
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:09,490
You did something so terrible to them!

219
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:43,070
[Golden Dragon Hall]

220
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,320
Hong.

221
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:03,260
My good Hong.

222
00:15:12,650 --> 00:15:13,740
Come here.

223
00:15:14,870 --> 00:15:15,670
Slow down.

224
00:15:18,630 --> 00:15:19,510
Are you tired?

225
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:23,080
My good Hong...

226
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:40,150
Yu'er...

227
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,510
Hong, Hong.

228
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,080
My...

229
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:51,910
I'm coming to find you.

230
00:16:07,030 --> 00:16:08,150
H-How...

231
00:16:08,670 --> 00:16:10,010
How did that happen?

232
00:16:10,390 --> 00:16:11,200
How did it...

233
00:16:17,730 --> 00:16:19,710
[Golden Dragon Hall]

234
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,250
What's going on?

235
00:16:44,150 --> 00:16:46,150
So the core of the mechanism is here.

236
00:16:49,870 --> 00:16:51,390
Meng Rui, Yan,

237
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:52,240
try to

238
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:53,870
destroy the dragon head directly.

239
00:16:53,870 --> 00:16:54,870
I'll find a way

240
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:56,440
to stop the mechanism.

241
00:16:57,030 --> 00:16:57,870
Okay.

242
00:16:57,870 --> 00:16:58,670
Be careful.

243
00:17:03,480 --> 00:17:04,270
Zhu!

244
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:14,720
I have an idea.

245
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:16,440
Divine Constable Li.

246
00:18:23,270 --> 00:18:24,130
Your Highness.

247
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,790
You must never again

248
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:29,110
disregard your own safety like this.

249
00:18:29,110 --> 00:18:31,310
Thank you, Divine Constable Qingyang.

250
00:18:55,270 --> 00:18:56,130
Your Highness.

251
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,550
My condolences.

252
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:02,740
I promised him before that I would return

253
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:04,700
to the palace this year

254
00:19:06,070 --> 00:19:08,070
to stay up for the New Year together.

255
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:17,160
Ye.

256
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:20,640
I failed to protect you.

257
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:25,200
I'm sorry.

258
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:34,500
Your Highness.

259
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:39,110
This is not your fault.

260
00:19:40,880 --> 00:19:42,810
It's all the Crown Prince's doing.

261
00:19:43,830 --> 00:19:46,090
As the father of the Grand Heir Apparent,

262
00:19:47,270 --> 00:19:48,400
not only did he fail to protect

263
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:49,550
his own son,

264
00:19:50,070 --> 00:19:52,200
but he even used him.

265
00:19:54,750 --> 00:19:56,920
He is completely unfit to be a father.

266
00:20:01,070 --> 00:20:02,000
Ms. Bai,

267
00:20:04,830 --> 00:20:05,830
have you found out

268
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:09,160
how exactly Ye died?

269
00:20:10,350 --> 00:20:11,510
Your Highness,

270
00:20:12,270 --> 00:20:13,200
just now,

271
00:20:13,550 --> 00:20:15,270
I found multiple traces of poisoning

272
00:20:15,270 --> 00:20:17,550
on the Grand Heir Apparent's body.

273
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:19,880
But whether he was actually poisoned

274
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,070
and, if so, by what,

275
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,680
requires

276
00:20:23,030 --> 00:20:24,290
further examination.

277
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,550
Poisoning?

278
00:20:29,640 --> 00:20:31,480
Eldest Brother, Second Brother.

279
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:32,950
If even one's own flesh and blood

280
00:20:32,950 --> 00:20:34,080
can be disregarded,

281
00:20:34,750 --> 00:20:36,310
what is the point

282
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:41,300
of sitting on that dragon throne?

283
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:49,200
General,

284
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:50,580
the casualties in Gutan County

285
00:20:50,580 --> 00:20:51,740
have been tallied.

286
00:20:51,830 --> 00:20:53,550
1,759 civilians have died

287
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:55,200
from the Chiying bugs.

288
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,140
Right now, this number

289
00:20:57,750 --> 00:20:58,950
