Ye.

573
00:37:07,630 --> 00:37:08,440
This toast is for you...

574
00:37:07,870 --> 00:37:14,130
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

575
00:37:09,440 --> 00:37:10,920
as your fourth uncle.

576
00:37:14,900 --> 00:37:17,960
♪ Dare not think ♪

577
00:37:18,210 --> 00:37:21,170
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

578
00:37:20,250 --> 00:37:22,400
If the truth is covered up like this,

579
00:37:22,180 --> 00:37:28,450
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

580
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:24,320
then who can give the people of the world

581
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,280
justice?

582
00:37:25,710 --> 00:37:26,550
Father,

583
00:37:26,300 --> 00:37:27,990
[Tavern]

584
00:37:26,960 --> 00:37:28,290
since you can't give it,

585
00:37:28,410 --> 00:37:29,540
I will.

586
00:37:30,150 --> 00:37:34,110
♪ Forever within your shadow
by your side ♪

587
00:37:33,970 --> 00:37:36,380
[Yu'an Hall]

588
00:37:35,400 --> 00:37:38,110
We have received great favor
from Your Majesty.

589
00:37:38,670 --> 00:37:40,230
Therefore, we should be loyal

590
00:37:40,230 --> 00:37:41,920
and advise Your Majesty.

591
00:37:42,670 --> 00:37:44,280
If the ruler’s conduct is improper,

592
00:37:44,280 --> 00:37:45,880
the minister has failed in his duty.

593
00:37:45,880 --> 00:37:48,250
How can we remain silent, Your Majesty?

594
00:37:52,800 --> 00:37:55,230
If the ruler’s conduct is improper,

595
00:37:55,280 --> 00:37:57,150
the minister has failed in his duty.

596
00:37:57,150 --> 00:37:59,920
How can we remain silent, Your Majesty?

597
00:38:01,030 --> 00:38:03,510
If the ruler’s conduct is improper,

598
00:38:03,800 --> 00:38:05,630
the minister has failed in his duty.

599
00:38:05,630 --> 00:38:08,500
How can we remain silent, Your Majesty?

600
00:38:22,280 --> 00:38:23,320
My Lords,

601
00:38:23,590 --> 00:38:25,280
His Majesty is unwell today.

602
00:38:25,280 --> 00:38:27,670
Please go back.

603
00:38:29,070 --> 00:38:31,070
If His Majesty

604
00:38:31,070 --> 00:38:32,670
insists on not seeing us today,

605
00:38:32,670 --> 00:38:34,230
I will

606
00:38:34,230 --> 00:38:36,230
smash my head on these jade steps!

607
00:38:38,190 --> 00:38:39,000
This...

608
00:38:53,030 --> 00:38:53,920
Third Brother,

609
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:56,100
watch your words and actions.

610
00:38:56,550 --> 00:38:58,280
It's not directed at you today.

611
00:38:58,300 --> 00:39:00,220
Why stick your neck out?

612
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:02,480
After all these years,

613
00:39:02,480 --> 00:39:03,400
haven't you learned

614
00:39:03,400 --> 00:39:05,360
the proper etiquette before the Emperor?

615
00:39:05,360 --> 00:39:06,400
Etiquette

616
00:39:07,190 --> 00:39:08,230
is based on benevolence

617
00:39:08,230 --> 00:39:09,360
and righteousness.

618
00:39:10,070 --> 00:39:11,710
Without benevolence and righteousness,

619
00:39:11,710 --> 00:39:14,040
when the people are treated like animals,

620
00:39:15,820 --> 00:39:17,820
what etiquette is there to speak of?

621
00:39:22,330 --> 00:39:24,080
Your Majesty!

622
00:39:24,920 --> 00:39:26,010
No!

623
00:39:31,190 --> 00:39:31,980
My Lord.

624
00:39:34,150 --> 00:39:34,880
Li Qingyang?

625
00:39:34,880 --> 00:39:35,740
Sit down first.

626
00:39:36,590 --> 00:39:37,400
Qingyang,

627
00:39:37,670 --> 00:39:39,000
what are you doing here?

628
00:39:39,400 --> 00:39:40,840
How dare you break into the Yuque

629
00:39:40,840 --> 00:39:42,480
without being summoned?

630
00:39:42,550 --> 00:39:43,360
Qingyang,

631
00:39:43,480 --> 00:39:44,340
leave quickly.

632
00:39:44,840 --> 00:39:45,590
Guards,

633
00:39:45,590 --> 00:39:46,410
arrest him!

634
00:39:46,440 --> 00:39:47,230
Wait!

635
00:39:52,550 --> 00:39:53,880
We must first figure out

636
00:39:54,280 --> 00:39:56,480
why Divine Constable Qingyang is here.

637
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:02,710
My Lord,

638
00:40:03,030 --> 00:40:04,630
don't be so reckless again.

639
00:40:04,820 --> 00:40:06,340
Rest well first.

640
00:40:11,280 --> 00:40:12,590
Who is this person?

641
00:40:13,190 --> 00:40:14,760
I've never seen him before.

642
00:40:21,630 --> 00:40:22,960
Divine Constable Qingyang,

643
00:40:22,960 --> 00:40:23,710
do you know

644
00:40:23,710 --> 00:40:26,110
the consequences of trespassing in Yuque?

645
00:40:32,960 --> 00:40:33,840
Eunuch Guo.

646
00:40:34,440 --> 00:40:35,840
I have an item

647
00:40:36,440 --> 00:40:37,900
that I would like to ask you

648
00:40:38,960 --> 00:40:40,420
to present to His Majesty.

649
00:41:11,960 --> 00:41:13,160
Divine Constable Li,

650
00:41:13,710 --> 00:41:14,550
please wait.

651
00:41:18,370 --> 00:41:21,370
[Yu'an Hall]

652
00:41:35,930 --> 00:41:41,790
[Yu'an Hall]

653
00:41:57,670 --> 00:41:58,480
Your Majesty,

654
00:41:59,480 --> 00:42:01,110
I have a request.

655
00:42:03,230 --> 00:42:05,000
No matter what I say,

656
00:42:05,280 --> 00:42:07,610
Your Majesty must take care of your health

657
00:42:08,250 --> 00:42:09,800
and not get worked up.

658
00:42:11,150 --> 00:42:11,960
Please...

659
00:42:12,800 --> 00:42:14,030
Have a look.

660
00:42:47,070 --> 00:42:47,960
Your Majesty,

661
00:42:49,580 --> 00:42:50,910
the Fourth Highness...

662
00:42:52,240 --> 00:42:56,220
The Fourth Highness
you've been longing for,

663
00:42:56,340 --> 00:42:59,950
[Yan]

664
00:42:57,440 --> 00:42:58,960
has returned.

665
00:43:05,670 --> 00:43:06,670
Yan?

666
00:43:07,280 --> 00:43:09,070
He has returned!

667
00:43:16,430 --> 00:43:18,540
[Yan]

668
00:43:16,550 --> 00:43:17,360
That's great!

669
00:43:17,360 --> 00:43:19,400
The grasshopper Father made me

670
00:43:19,550 --> 00:43:22,070
is the most beautiful in the world!

671
00:43:21,820 --> 00:43:24,700
[Breezes of Auspices]

672
00:43:23,400 --> 00:43:24,590
I will weave a hundred grasshoppers

673
00:43:24,590 --> 00:43:26,150
for you, Yan.

674
00:43:26,150 --> 00:43:27,350
Grasshoppers!

675
00:43:29,710 --> 00:43:30,760
It's him.

676
00:43:32,840 --> 00:43:34,000
It's Yan.

677
00:43:35,930 --> 00:43:38,790
Yan is back!

678
00:43:39,190 --> 00:43:40,880
Open the doors. Hurry!

679
00:43:41,190 --> 00:43:42,760
By His Majesty's verbal decree!

680
00:43:42,760 --> 00:43:43,560
Summoning...

681
00:43:48,000 --> 00:43:49,670
By His Majesty's verbal decree,

682
00:43:49,670 --> 00:43:51,330
summoning the Fourth Prince,

683
00:43:51,630 --> 00:43:53,700
Zhou Yan, for an audience!

684
00:44:05,550 --> 00:44:06,320
Zhou Yan?

685
00:44:10,590 --> 00:44:12,010
The Fourth Prince?

686
00:44:12,960 --> 00:44:13,920
Eunuch Guo,

687
00:44:14,480 --> 00:44:16,140
are you old and senile,

688
00:44:16,400 --> 00:44:18,360
or deaf and hard of hearing?

689
00:44:19,880 --> 00:44:22,150
The crime of forging an imperial decree...

690
00:44:22,150 --> 00:44:23,880
Can you bear the consequences?

691
00:44:24,960 --> 00:44:26,030
Are you kidding me?

692
00:44:26,280 --> 00:44:27,360
Say it again!

693
00:44:27,880 --> 00:44:29,150
Say it!

694
00:44:55,150 --> 00:44:56,590
I knew I felt a special connection

695
00:44:56,590 --> 00:44:58,440
when I first met you.

696
00:45:07,960 --> 00:45:08,890
Eldest Brother.

697
00:45:13,190 --> 00:45:14,120
Second Brother.

698
00:45:14,440 --> 00:45:15,370
Fourth Brother.

699
00:45:21,150 --> 00:45:22,670
After 17 years,

700
00:45:23,630 --> 00:45:24,710
we are finally

701
00:45:27,280 --> 00:45:28,710
reunited.

702
00:45:48,360 --> 00:45:49,220
Third Brother.

703
00:46:06,760 --> 00:46:07,550
Eunuch Guo.

704
00:46:08,440 --> 00:46:09,440
At your service.

705
00:46:09,630 --> 00:46:10,840
Follow me to see His Majesty.

706
00:46:10,840 --> 00:46:11,630
Yes.

707
00:46:12,550 --> 00:46:13,360
Open the doors!
